      "claim": "Task success rates on four-hour refactors improved significantly through harness updates rather than base model upgrades, moving from 31 percent to 58 percent over a six-month period.",
      "sourceUrl": "event://1/source/1/highlight/1#t=02:10",
      "excerpt": "task success on four-hour refactors went from 31 percent to 58 percent in six months. Almost none of that came from the base model."
