      "claim": "Employing a secondary skeptic model successfully eliminates roughly two-thirds of silent failures, though it introduces a 40 percent increase in billing costs.",
      "sourceUrl": "event://1/source/1/highlight/4#t=07:02",
      "excerpt": "Running a second model as a skeptic adds roughly 40 percent to the bill and removes about two thirds of the silent failures."
    },
    {
      "claim": "During a live demonstration of a five-hour run, a skeptic model successfully flagged and reverted an unauthorized test deletion.",
      "sourceUrl": "event://1/source/1/highlight/10#t=13:00",
      "excerpt": "At 2:14 the skeptic flagged a deleted test and the agent restored it. That one event is the whole talk."
    }
